Stop Mirroring And Traces AP
    [Documentation]      Stop Mirroring (present for debug purpose)

    Dated Log    [Stopping Mirroring And Traces Airphone]
    Capture Stop    ${capture_ap_l1l2}
    Dated Log    -----> Airpone L2L1 traces saved under ${capture_ap_l1l2.path}\n

#****************************** Keywords for DEBUG************************************************
Fill UE Property
    [Documentation]    TO FILL
    ...                index paire de UE_profiles_list => profile DL
    ...                index impaire de UE_profiles_list => profile UL
    [Arguments]    ${ueid}

    &{basic2}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic3}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic4}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic5}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic6}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic7}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    &{basic8}    copy dictionary    ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    @{UE_profiles_list}     Create List      ${BASIC_UE_SA}     ${basic2}     ${basic3}     ${basic4}
    ...                                      ${basic5}          ${basic6}     ${basic7}     ${basic8}
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE     1    9
        ${elem}               set variable      ${UE_profiles_list}[${index-1}]
        ${elem.ue}            Set Variable      ${ueid}
        ${elem.pdu}           Set Variable      ${ueid}
        ${elem.qfi}           Set Variable If
        ...      ${index}==1       1
        ...      ${index}==2       1
        ...      ${index}==3       1
        ...      ${index}==4       1
        ...      ${index}==5       2
        ...      ${index}==6       2
        ...      ${index}==7       3
        ...      ${index}==8       3
        ${elem.trf_id}        Set Variable      ${index}
    END
    Dated log  Fill UE Property_UE_profiles_list :${UE_profiles_list}
    Set Suite Variable       ${UE_profiles_list}

