#     #en attendant de passer un argument  avec postprocessing
#     ${Cell_id}          Set Variable    3

#     ${pattern}=         Set Variable   PxyCellUeProtoControlHandler: MT_CELL_SETUP_REQ received for cell ${Cell_id}
#     Dated Log           Check_AirPhone_is_waiting_DSScellsetup_commands: ${pattern}

#     ${output}           SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
# 	...                 command=grep -i ${pattern} /tmp/startup_l3.log
#     ...                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}

#     Dated Log           check in APL3: ${pattern}
#     Should Contain	    ${output}	 ${pattern}

